  "title": "Advantech ADAM-4150 7-DI/8-DO Module",
  "description": "Thing Model for the Advantech ADAM-4150 robust RS-485 module with 7 digital inputs and 8 open-collector digital outputs in Modbus RTU mode. It reads the digital input signals, the pulse output modes, the input and output status words, the module name, the firmware version words and the communication safety status. Addresses follow the ADAM-4100 Series User Manual Ed. 7, Appendix B, Tables B.3 and B.4. The individual output coils 00017–00024 are documented as write only, so outputs are read from the status word. The 32-bit counter and frequency registers are omitted because their word order is not documented. The module must be configured for Modbus RTU rather than ADAM ASCII. Firmware is not stated. No hardware validation is claimed.",
